s leading to lots of combinations. Recruit helper coins and find pennies to gain additional passive skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges &amp; Replayability</strong> |\u00a0Unlock new characters and collect 70+ player coin faces. Randomize runs with difficulty modifiers and alternate character loadouts. Can you win a run with every character pair?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596130/extras/61302b482e53927ef16c4c65e017848c.poster.avif?t=1770478993\" width=1170 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596130/extras/61302b482e53927ef16c4c65e017848c.webm?t=1770478993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596130/extras/61302b482e53927ef16c4c65e017848c.mp4?t=1770478993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Sketch House Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596130/6a556b040015db7bdc9137c8c03032413728a01b/header.jpg?t=1770478993","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596130/256431024/7a809ea425c2e052124ed67a3bd75efe589c97a0/1755730404/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755732242","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596130/256431024/7a809ea425c2e052124ed67a3bd75efe589c97a0/1755730404/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755732242","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596130/256431024/7a809ea425c2e052124ed67a3bd75efe589c97a0/1755730404/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755732242","id":257138977,"name":"Pre-Alpha Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as