ack your foes in tactical lane-based combat. Upgrade coins with new faces unique to every character to build complex combos. The forces of Chaos are coming\u2026so use your heads (and tails)!","steam_appid":3596130,"support_info":{"email":"support@sketchhousegames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}